WEBVTT

00:08.840 --> 00:17.110
The canary has forgotten his song

00:18.380 --> 00:26.880
Shall we abandon him in the mountains?

00:27.890 --> 00:37.090
No, we mustn't do that

02:39.450 --> 02:44.410
Thirteenth Night


02:39.450 --> 02:44.410
Black Fable

02:57.240 --> 03:02.270
Perhaps it's time for you, too,
to remove your false mask!

03:03.250 --> 03:06.240
This face is not false.

03:06.580 --> 03:09.720
It is the face I chose

03:09.720 --> 03:13.120
to shoulder the mission that was my friend's.

03:13.520 --> 03:18.480
In other words, this face is the truth
that must now be told!

03:18.860 --> 03:22.520
Living in a covenant with Darkness,
by which I abide!

03:23.800 --> 03:26.790
In that case, you are Evil!

03:34.340 --> 03:42.770
And possessed of the power to destroy
that Evil, I am Justice!

03:43.320 --> 03:44.890
This can't be!

03:44.890 --> 03:47.860
Say it isn't so, Yamagi!

03:49.930 --> 03:52.830
Stop! Don't make me shoot you!

03:56.000 --> 03:57.620
Shinjo!

03:58.670 --> 04:02.690
You were the one who taught
me to be a good cop!

04:03.410 --> 04:07.080
I always thought we were the good guys!

04:07.080 --> 04:09.940
But you...you...

04:10.150 --> 04:11.940
Strength is Justice!

04:14.920 --> 04:17.690
That's why I sought it!

04:17.690 --> 04:19.960
A more perfect soul...

04:19.960 --> 04:22.390
A more perfect body...

04:22.390 --> 04:24.690
Greater power!

04:24.690 --> 04:26.750
In other words, strength!

04:26.860 --> 04:29.690
Well? You can't argue with that, can you?

04:36.500 --> 04:38.600
Here, aim here!

04:53.460 --> 04:56.660
Oh, dear! How awful!

04:56.660 --> 05:01.530
Is that how you treat your
flesh and blood, Father?

05:01.530 --> 05:04.990
Masaki, stop this! Let Maya go!

05:06.400 --> 05:09.340
Your concern is unmerited.

05:09.340 --> 05:12.070
We're bound together to the death!

05:12.070 --> 05:20.040
She is both wife and mother to me,
as I am reborn, a new human race!

05:20.750 --> 05:22.150
As I feared...

05:22.150 --> 05:25.190
I am the root of these wrongs.

05:25.190 --> 05:27.480
There is no call for sadness.

05:27.860 --> 05:32.330
Your son will be the proud bearer
of your legacy, Father.

05:32.330 --> 05:36.430
The Gago Project was a plan to
create a new human race.

05:36.430 --> 05:40.440
It aspired to lead Humanity to new horizons.

05:40.440 --> 05:43.710
And poised at its apex,

05:43.710 --> 05:46.900
I will right the world's wrongs!

05:48.080 --> 05:50.770
A new era begins tonight!

05:52.110 --> 05:54.550
On this very spot!

05:54.550 --> 05:59.790
Since the Great War, our land has been
divided in two, our citizens divided!

05:59.790 --> 06:03.660
We stand now to rectify this lamentable state,

06:03.660 --> 06:09.700
and restore our nation to its rightful place
as the leader of Asia!

06:09.700 --> 06:12.560
Yeah!

06:12.730 --> 06:14.360
Major...

06:18.540 --> 06:22.140
What a stirring speech!

06:22.810 --> 06:27.680
You must be Major Kanji Isurugi, of the
Eastern Theater Strategic Operations.

06:28.750 --> 06:35.690
Your exclusionary, self-satisfied mentality
is exactly what we're looking for!

06:35.690 --> 06:38.180
You must be Brain Gear!

06:39.560 --> 06:45.430
But I'm afraid we've derailed your little plan.

06:46.030 --> 06:51.610
By now, we've stopped General Okonogi and
Colonel Amagi of Narashino

06:51.610 --> 06:53.310
before they were able to lead
the Ichinotani uprising.

06:53.310 --> 06:55.540
Cut the bullshit, you son-of-a...

06:57.310 --> 06:59.650
This toy is too powerful for you.

06:59.650 --> 07:02.410
We'll take it off your hands.

07:08.160 --> 07:09.820
Foreign bastard!

07:13.760 --> 07:16.420
You were a good mentor.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.940
It's okay.

07:22.940 --> 07:24.560
It's okay now!

07:28.980 --> 07:31.210
Wh-What's happening?!

07:31.380 --> 07:32.750
A divine message!

07:32.750 --> 07:34.920
Don't let them leave the city!

07:34.920 --> 07:38.390
Obliterate the evildoers!

07:38.390 --> 07:40.790
What on earth's happening?

07:41.060 --> 07:44.510
A holy message, the time of
atonement has come!

07:49.600 --> 07:51.220
Maya...

08:07.820 --> 08:12.020
Wonderful! What a beautiful body!

08:12.020 --> 08:17.010
Exactly what I sought:
Perfect, complete power!

08:28.670 --> 08:31.400
You still don't understand, do you?

08:34.580 --> 08:36.200
Damn...

08:37.750 --> 08:40.520
Take them and go. I'll handle this.

08:40.520 --> 08:43.450
Don't be absurd! I can't leave
a woman alone here!

08:43.650 --> 08:46.520
Oh? I'm stronger than you, dear!

08:46.520 --> 08:48.150
Yeah, but...

08:49.020 --> 08:51.620
Besides, I have instructions.

08:52.090 --> 08:55.320
I want to ask something of you.

08:56.030 --> 09:00.830
I want you to protect the children, and...

09:02.140 --> 09:04.630
...and live as a human.

09:07.640 --> 09:09.970
He meant a great deal to me.

09:16.580 --> 09:18.210
Now!

09:19.350 --> 09:21.150
You're going to live as a human, right?

09:21.220 --> 09:23.280
Dress decently!

09:32.100 --> 09:35.330
All right, bring it on!
I'll play with you.

09:35.470 --> 09:38.030
I happen to be in a pretty good mood.

10:09.440 --> 10:11.170
This is Sakura.

10:11.170 --> 10:16.300
Mission achieved in target area.
Awaiting further orders. Over.

10:31.790 --> 10:33.420
Fire! Fire!

10:52.510 --> 10:54.780
Retreat! Retreat!

10:59.490 --> 11:04.150
Currently battling unidentified enemy!
Send backup immediately!

11:04.260 --> 11:06.750
What's going on, Sakura?
I can barely hear you!

11:11.800 --> 11:14.770
You're rushing too much.

11:15.170 --> 11:18.610
In the world to come, you need to
work slowly and carefully.

11:18.610 --> 11:21.080
Tighten a single thread around
the enemy's neck!

11:21.080 --> 11:22.780
You piece of...

11:22.780 --> 11:24.400
You monster!

11:25.650 --> 11:27.270
Major...

11:31.350 --> 11:34.290
You dreamed too big.

11:51.870 --> 11:54.470
It's no use, Father!

11:57.410 --> 12:01.750
Nothing can injure my perfect body!

12:16.930 --> 12:19.700
There's no getting through to you, is there?

12:20.330 --> 12:22.100
You're in the way!

12:27.510 --> 12:29.940
Now, Father...

12:46.060 --> 12:48.630
What? What's this?

12:48.630 --> 12:51.630
What's wrong? What's happening to me?

12:51.630 --> 12:53.790
He's lost control?

12:54.200 --> 12:57.000
He's missing something he needs
to control that body.

12:58.770 --> 13:03.510
Something that was there once,
but has been taken from its rightful place.

13:04.180 --> 13:06.080
That's right! The...

13:09.280 --> 13:11.340
I heard that!

13:11.450 --> 13:16.690
I need that face for my justice, right?

13:20.500 --> 13:22.290
Save my daughter...

13:23.060 --> 13:25.330
Save Maya!

13:28.270 --> 13:29.270
Mr. Kuroshio...

13:29.270 --> 13:30.940
That face...

13:30.940 --> 13:34.370
Give it to me!

13:52.530 --> 13:55.720
Demons chasing dreams, huh?

14:01.500 --> 14:05.130
Poor thing, you're still alive?

14:11.180 --> 14:13.200
Gotcha!

14:13.810 --> 14:15.440
Huh?

14:16.380 --> 14:21.460
If power is Justice, the power
to kill you is also just!

14:21.460 --> 14:26.090
That hurts! You're hurting me!

14:29.060 --> 14:32.190
Time for you to die!

14:34.370 --> 14:37.310
Miserable soul, mired in greed,

14:37.310 --> 14:39.640
entrust thyself to the call of Darkness!

14:40.140 --> 14:42.910
Silence!

15:11.370 --> 15:14.710
Quit moving around!

15:19.780 --> 15:22.310
You said too much.

15:22.550 --> 15:25.790
True Evil is silent.

15:25.790 --> 15:27.460
No!

15:27.460 --> 15:29.150
Mother...

15:45.870 --> 15:47.500
Hayato!

16:17.440 --> 16:20.570
You came for me?

16:23.810 --> 16:26.110
I know.

16:28.220 --> 16:31.620
It's too late for me.

16:47.370 --> 16:49.800
Brother!

17:07.520 --> 17:09.150
Yoshio...

17:12.530 --> 17:18.760
I now see what you saw.

17:19.370 --> 17:23.390
All of it.

17:34.150 --> 17:42.610
The canary has forgotten his song

17:43.720 --> 17:52.150
Shall we flog him with a willow lash?

17:53.200 --> 18:01.940
No, for that is too cruel

18:10.520 --> 18:12.690
What do you think, Professor?

18:12.690 --> 18:15.950
Don't worry, he'll be reborn.

18:25.900 --> 18:28.600
Happy birthday.

