19:09.340 --> 19:11.110
The true story of the Otomo City Tragedy
has been shrouded in darkness.

19:11.650 --> 19:15.980
Very few remain who know the truth.

19:16.620 --> 19:22.390
Those who have survived never
wish to speak of it again.

19:26.930 --> 19:32.590
Nobody knows what became of
Mikogami Hayato after that.

19:33.370 --> 19:39.640
Perhaps he really was Tatsuo Kagura.

19:39.640 --> 19:43.640
That outlandish thought
has crossed my mind.

19:43.640 --> 19:51.590
In the sequestered city of Otomo,
that secret battle between two young men...

19:51.590 --> 19:54.210
What will it mean for our future?

20:14.880 --> 20:23.980
There is only one sky,
though the world is large

20:24.120 --> 20:28.660
When you lose sight of the one you love

20:28.660 --> 20:34.250
Look up at it for strength

20:34.400 --> 20:43.540
The path we walked together
now splits into two

20:43.540 --> 20:52.380
Our tears show how much
we long to meet again

20:52.650 --> 20:57.220
The you of tomorrow will be born tomorrow

20:57.220 --> 21:02.390
Just as the Sun rises after a long night

21:02.390 --> 21:06.390
Throw away all the rest of the dream

21:06.390 --> 21:10.660
And open your arms!

21:10.900 --> 21:15.540
The future is always right before your eyes

21:15.540 --> 21:20.540
Just waiting for you to step forward

21:20.540 --> 21:24.650
Beyond the horizon

21:24.650 --> 21:32.450
A world awaits you, and new encounters

21:36.920 --> 21:43.700
I am the First and the Last.

21:43.700 --> 21:46.630
The one who lives again.

21:47.130 --> 21:50.500
I died once, but behold!

21:50.500 --> 21:56.340
I live again, across the generations,
holding the keys to Death and Hell.

22:00.150 --> 22:05.450
Then will you serve the Black Phantom?

22:06.790 --> 22:09.020
Everything...

22:10.320 --> 22:10.890
FOR THE BLACK
PHANTOM...

22:10.890 --> 22:14.600
FOR THE BLACK
PHANTOM...

22:10.890 --> 22:14.600

...for the Black Phantom!

22:14.600 --> 22:15.580
FOR THE BLACK
PHANTOM...

